From: Claude <claude@mdlawson.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:48:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Test harness: SD latency for the DSpico cart, data
 permission write trace

MELON_TRACE_DPERM=1 logs every change to the arm9's data permissions with
the pc that made it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CwsEkqb8ecKxcrBh97pUFG
---
 src/CP15.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/CP15.cpp b/src/CP15.cpp
index 9fa0281..443d470 100644
--- a/src/CP15.cpp
+++ b/src/CP15.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include <cstdlib>
 /*
     Copyright 2016-2026 melonDS team
 
@@ -542,6 +543,8 @@ void ARMv5::CP15Write(u32 id, u32 val)
 
     case 0x502: // data permissions
         {
+            if (getenv("MELON_TRACE_DPERM") && (PU_DataRW ^ val))
+                Log(LogLevel::Warn, "dperm %08X -> %08X at pc %08X cpsr %08X\n", PU_DataRW, val, R[15], CPSR);
             u32 diff = PU_DataRW ^ val;
             PU_DataRW = val;
             for (u32 i = 0; i < 8; i++)
